WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.220
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.710
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:11.490
A new friend appears this time!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.660
I wonder what type of character she is?

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.980
Uh-oh! She ran off somewhere!

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.870
Oh dear! We should go after her!

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.490
What adventure awaits us?

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:22.600
Doki!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.410
Pyon Pyon

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.570
Fumu Fumu

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.080
Howa Howa

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.280
Kira Kira

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.210
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.970
What color is your egg?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.750
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.790
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.640
I know you really love me.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:57.310
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.980
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.040
Because you believe in me,

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.800
I can do anything!

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:14.100
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.810
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:23.470
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:27.180
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:30.830
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:35.740
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.880
Pyon Pyon

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.030
Fumu Fumu

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:41.970
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.520
Howa Howa

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.730
Kira Kira

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:45.680
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.420
What color is your egg?

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:51.230
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:58.350 --> 00:01:59.340
There.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.570
Hinako, are you sure you didn't forget anything?

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:07.220
I'm sure.

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.570
Okay, let's go.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.750
That was scary.

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.270
Are the boxes okay?

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:27.220
I didn't hear anything break, so they should be fine.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:34.750
Huh?

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.720
That feeling...

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:37.210
It couldn't be...

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.370
What's the matter?

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.520
Everyone, look!

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.390
It's a Guardian Egg!

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:52.390
Reach Her! Kiran's Feelings!

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:52.390
Episode 61

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:55.250
So this is the Guardian Egg someone dropped?

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:59.070
Whoever dropped it must be quite worried.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.060
Who on earth could it be?

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:04.570
Wouldn't we be able to find its owner if it hatches?

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:09.680
Yeah, that's true. The Guardian Character inside should know who its bearer is.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.670
Does it look like it's about to hatch?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.010
Even we don't...

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.940
...know when the eggs will hatch.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.210
Ah, okay.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:20.550
Crap! Class is starting!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.100
You better run to the middle school section, or you'll be late.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.710
Watch over this little one until after school, okay?

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.100
Roger!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.110
Watching over his subjects is the King's duty!

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.290
Leave this to me.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.560
That's our Kiseki, always reliable.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.300
It'd be nice if the egg hatches soon.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:41.270
I can't wait to see what kind of person will be born!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.270
Look, look! Isn't it cool?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:52.150
It's a wake-wakey dance! One, two, one, two!

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:55.480
These cookies are delicious. Please come out.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.270
It's a baby, so these should work-dechu!

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:01.470
This is an order from your King! Show your face this instant, commoner!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.140
No good?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.640
Don't worry! If we all combine our powers...

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.890
No, no, no!

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:16.590
I'm tired.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:19.700
It won't hatch, no matter what we do.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:34.800
It'll be okay, hurry on out.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:38.430
Hinako-chan and everyone are waiting for you.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.020
Look, guys! Is it...

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.560
Hatching?!

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:59.160
Yay!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.770
I hatched, I hatched!

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.880
She's covered in sparkles!

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.270
What's your name?

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.180
I'm Kiran! Nice to meet you!

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:15.220
Kiran-chan? What a cute name.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.640
Thank you!

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.580
Oh no, I have to go!

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:22.390
Thanks for looking after me, everyone!

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.200
There she goes.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.770
She follows her own rhythm, doesn't she?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:32.350
I wonder if that egg is okay.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.750
Coming through!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.560
What is it, Hinamori-san?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.520
U-Um...

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.940
Amu?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.280
Over there.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.880
She hatched.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.210
Amu-chan!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.710
Hey, guys, did that egg hatch?

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:52.520
Yep, and she's named Kiran.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:56.920
Sensei, is Kiran-chan here?

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.000
Over there.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.020
Thank you very much.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.190
Let's go!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.060
Right.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.110
I'm coming!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:12.260
Newborn subject! Newborn subject! {We could also do "Young commoner/subject"}

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:16.020
Yeah, very good!

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:18.720
See, it's simple, right?

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:24.650
Hey, what in blazes are you doing?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.050
I was helping with her flying practice.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:29.180
That's not what I meant.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:35.000
This King here will teach you now.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:35.910
What?!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.360
Hey, hold it!

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:43.190
This isn't good.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.200
There she is-dechu!

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.930
Found you!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.010
Peek-a-boo!

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:59.640
Yeah, yeah! Spin, spin, spin!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.450
Yay, yay-dechu!

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:07.700
My, he's suddenly happy.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.100
Thank goodness.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.020
He stopped crying!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.190
Are we finished now-dechu?

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:17.060
Kiran's gone.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:22.800
There you are!

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:32.400
Oh, that's odd.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:35.850
My shoulders sudden feel so relaxed!

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:42.140
Why was I doing something like that?

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:42.900
Hey!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.770
Huh? Where did she go?

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:50.260
I just have to help Mom!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.500
There she is!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.840
You just hatched, you know.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:04.440
It's dangerous to fly off on your own.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.410
All right, all right!

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.260
Yep, perfect.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.810
I can't sleep forever.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.310
Thank you!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:50.320
There they are!

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.390
Hey there!

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:59.760
Sorry to trouble you, but I simply <i>must</i> make everyone sparkle!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:05.020
If someone's in trouble, or they're crying, I want to give them all a sparkling smile!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.750
I understand the sentiment, but...

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:11.490
Oh, right! I was in the middle of going back to Hinako-chan's!

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:14.390
Hinako? Is that the name of your Character Bearer?

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:17.930
Yeah! Mizutani Hinako-chan, a first-grader in elementary school.

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.760
She's a very kind girl.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:22.040
Do you know where she is?

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.220
No, I don't!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:29.310
Hinako-chan moved.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:32.260
That's when I was dropped.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.530
So how do you plan to go home, then?

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:38.110
It'll be okay! We're all under the same sky, right?

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:39.540
I'll definitely run into her!

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.160
She's remarkably positive.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:43.510
Or rather, optimistic.

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:50.660
I can feel Hinako-chan thinking about me, even from far away.

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.690
So it'll all work out!

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.060
A cat?

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:00.890
A kitten!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.880
Oh, no, it looks like it can't get down!

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:07.990
I'll be right there!

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:09.480
Wait! Hey!

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.820
Man, she sure is full of energy.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:16.970
I guess Hinako-chan really feels strongly about Kiran.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.640
I mean, look at how energetic she is.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:23.600
If the Character Bearer doesn't believe in their Guardian Character, they'll disappear.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.650
But...

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.260
If they believe in us, we're full of life!

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:31.930
We're all so lively because we're Amu-chan's would-be selves!

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:34.860
And I'm Rima's would-be self!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.060
And me, too!

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:37.390
And me-dechu!

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:39.100
And I!

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:41.930
Let's all search for Hinako-chan!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:43.800
Yeah!

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.340
Sparkly-nya!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:54.540
Yoru!

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.770
When did you...

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:58.580
Thanks for saving my pal there-nya.

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.550
I see.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.230
Her bearer?

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:05.960
But we don't have anything to go on-dechu.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.460
Okay, then I'll lend a hand-nya.

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.600
As thanks for saving my pal-nya!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.190
Get a move on, fleabags-nya!

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:22.890
And just like that, we have gathered the info-nya!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:27.090
We'll find her bearer...

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:31.600
Past the forest where the elephants live, after crossing the rainbow bridge,

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:36.470
near a city where a princess emerges, at an elementary school in the sea.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:38.180
That makes no sense.

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.850
Where could such a place be?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.150
Uh...

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:43.060
What's the matter?

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:46.100
Where is Kiran-chan?

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:50.100
Shoot.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.040
I'll help you!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.110
Kiran!

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:56.140
Guys, Kiran's over here!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.610
There you go.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.440
Are you okay-dechu?

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.320
Thanks, everybody.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.100
Everything will be just fine!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:36.510
Where...

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:38.510
Are we?!

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:41.700
No need to worry! Everything will be fine!

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.790
She's positive, all right.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:45.750
She's gone beyond positive-dechu.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.340
It's you!

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:50.680
Why is everyone here?

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.980
Heya!

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.710
Why are you two here?

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.560
Utau's coming to this town to do a concert tonight.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:02.740
The concert the other day was such a big hit, she's been really busy ever since.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:07.180
So that's why we thought we'd do some publicity!

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:10.060
Those are the flyers we handed out last time.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.300
Let me help!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.550
Who are you?

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.850
Oh, you're a new face.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.950
We'll help, too!

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:19.280
Sure!

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:21.890
But there is one problem-dechu.

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:25.430
No one can see us.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:26.650
I see.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:28.850
If we tried to hand out flyers...

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.130
Th-That was stupid of us.

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:36.680
That-dechu!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:42.000
Oh, he took it!

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.060
Il, the next flyer!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:46.640
I can't see a thing!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:47.880
So heavy.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.890
Miki, don't move!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.040
I'm trying, but...

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.870
Wow!

00:13:57.910 --> 00:13:59.560
Oh, it's a couple-dechu.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.350
Ready the flyers-dechu!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.310
What's that?

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.890
Left hand, hand out those flyers-dechu!

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:11.180
Right hand, a child is passing by! Wave the hand!

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.260
Shut up, don't order me around!

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:16.850
This is for Utau-chan's sake!

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:20.140
Now, walk forward-dechu.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.510
Walk forward?

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:31.430
Ran, Miki, Su!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.980
Pepe-chan!

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:34.010
Kusukusu!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:37.710
Sheesh, where did they run off to?

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:42.300
Utau?

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:46.340
I'm dead.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.890
We handed out all the flyers.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:51.100
I'm totally beat.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:55.890
Good work! Good work! Good work!

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:57.270
Good work!

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:59.630
Thank you very much.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:05.580
So yeah, why're you obsessed with making people sparkle?

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:08.640
Hinako is a really kind girl, you see.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:13.620
But she's shy, and can't make friends very easily.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:22.960
If her friends cry, she really just wants to call out, "are you okay?"

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.970
But she can't.

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:30.930
To be someone that can always make her friends sparkle...

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:33.710
That's the type of person she wishes she could be.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.560
And that's why I was born.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:39.810
So that's why you're so sparkly.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.370
You're searching for her, right?

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.260
Do you have any leads?

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.820
It said something about a forest with elephants...

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.390
But where the heck would that be?

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.070
My comrades' info is never wrong-nya!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.310
We know where that forest is.

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:57.930
If there's a forest with an elephant, I know that town.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:03.890
It's really here!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:08.290
Kiran, the forest with an elephant exists!

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.280
Hinako-chan must be near!

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.890
Hey, hey!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.360
Kiran!

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:19.510
What is it? What's the matter?

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:25.790
Hinako-chan... Hinako-chan is thinking she might never see me again.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.930
She's begun to give up!

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.850
If a Guardian Character isn't believed in...

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:33.340
Kiran-chan will disappear!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.680
What are we going to do?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:38.410
Calm down-dechu! We have to find the next clue-dechu!

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:39.980
The next clue is...

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:41.290
The rainbow bridge!

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.890
Rainbow bridge, where are you?

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:51.130
It's you!

00:16:58.230 --> 00:16:58.970
That's... {whoa, CG budget!}

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.760
The rainbow bridge!

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:04.270
I thank you!

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:10.990
Next, the city where a princess emerges-dechu!

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:13.910
Princess, come on out!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.830
Princess!

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:21.260
Where are you-nya?

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.140
The Princess!

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:35.700
All right! If we fly up there...

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.760
But we can't fly that high carrying Kiran!

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:42.260
We'll take a shortcut-nya! Just leave it to me-nya!

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.930
We made it!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.680
Next is the elementary school in the sea-dechu!

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.100
Kiran-chan!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.190
Kiran is disappearing!

